<title>CHINA: Trading in S.Megga shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in S.Megga shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of S. Megga International Holdings Ltd was suspended in the afternoon at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>Shares of the telecommunications products maker, one of most actively traded stocks by turnover, surged HK$0.18 or 18.95 percent to HK$1.13 at midday. Volume was 372.80 million shares worth HK$410.15 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
